{"id":"bc53ba723358facc","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-satisfaction.md","title":"Structures and Tarskian Satisfaction","display":"df-satisfaction — Structures and Tarskian Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-satisfaction","aliases":["67-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — Structures and Tarskian Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-arithmetic-language]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — Structures and Tarskian Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97e929795d778cd6\" href=\"?note=97e929795d778cd6\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-language\">67-df-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(F_L,R_L,a_L)\">\\(L=(F_L,R_L,a_L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的载体记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|M|\">\\(|M|\\)</span>，要求非空。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|M|\">\\(s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|M|\\)</span> 为赋值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[x\\mapsto a]\">\\(s[x\\mapsto a]\\)</span> 仅改变 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>项求值及公式满足关系按有限树递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models\\varphi\">\\(M\\models\\varphi\\)</span> 只对闭句使用，定义为对全部赋值成立。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models T\">\\(M\\models T\\)</span> 表示满足集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的每个句子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_A\">\\(\\mathbb N_A\\)</span> 为下式构造的标准算术结构；算术条目中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\)</span> 约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_A\\models\\varphi\">\\(\\mathbb N_A\\models\\varphi\\)</span>，不是对象理论自己的真谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(M_0,M_1,M_2)\">\\(M=(M_0,M_1,M_2)\\)</span>；零元函数的输入域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^0=\\{\\epsilon\\}\">\\(A^0=\\{\\epsilon\\}\\)</span>，其解释是该单点域上的函数。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_A\">\\(\\mathcal F_A\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\">\\(m,n\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 中变化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\times\">\\(0,S,+,\\times\\)</span> 在解释族的键位置表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span> 的函数符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_L\">\\(\\models_L\\)</span> 是固定签名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 的带类型写法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Str}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Str}_L\\)</span> 按所有集合载体的类记号解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal R\\)</span> 是以符号为索引的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in|M|\">\\(a\\in|M|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^k\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\\in|M|^k\">\\(\\vec a\\in|M|^k\\)</span>。单变量及同时赋值更新均取下式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Str}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal R):A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal F)=F_L\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R)=R_L\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in F_L\\ (\\mathcal F(f):A^{a_L(f)}\\to A)\n\\land\\forall R\\in R_L\\ (\\mathcal R(R)\\subseteq A^{a_L(R)})\\},\\\\\n|M|&amp;\\coloneqq M_0,&amp;f^M&amp;\\coloneqq M_1(f),&amp;R^M&amp;\\coloneqq M_2(R),\\\\\n(s[x\\mapsto a])(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;y=x,\\\\s(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(s[\\vec x\\mapsto\\vec a])(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\na_{\\iota i&lt;k\\ (x_i=y)},&amp;y\\in\\{x_i:i&lt;k\\},\\\\\ns(y),&amp;y\\notin\\{x_i:i&lt;k\\},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n⟦ x⟧_{M,s}&amp;\\coloneqq s(x),&amp;\n⟦ f(\\vec t)⟧_{M,s}&amp;\\coloneqq f^M((⟦ t_i⟧_{M,s})_i),\\\\\nM,s\\models(t=u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow⟦ t⟧_{M,s}=⟦ u⟧_{M,s},\\\\\nM,s\\models R(\\vec t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(⟦ t_i⟧_{M,s})_i\\in R^M,\\\\\nM,s\\models\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(M,s\\models\\varphi),\\\\\nM,s\\models\\varphi\\land\\psi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(M,s\\models\\varphi)\\land(M,s\\models\\psi),\\\\\nM,s\\models\\forall x\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in|M|\\ (M,s[x\\mapsto a]\\models\\varphi),\\\\\nM\\models\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in|M|^{\\mathrm{Var}_L}\\ (M,s\\models\\varphi),\\\\\nM\\models T&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\ (M\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathcal F_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(0,(\\epsilon\\mapsto0)),\n(S,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto n+1)),\n(+,(\\langle m,n\\rangle\\mapsto m+n)),\n(\\times,(\\langle m,n\\rangle\\mapsto mn))\\},\\\\\n\\mathbb N_A&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\mathcal F_A,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Str}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal R):A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal F)=F_L\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R)=R_L\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in F_L\\ (\\mathcal F(f):A^{a_L(f)}\\to A)\n\\land\\forall R\\in R_L\\ (\\mathcal R(R)\\subseteq A^{a_L(R)})\\},\\\\\n|M|&amp;\\coloneqq M_0,&amp;f^M&amp;\\coloneqq M_1(f),&amp;R^M&amp;\\coloneqq M_2(R),\\\\\n(s[x\\mapsto a])(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;y=x,\\\\s(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(s[\\vec x\\mapsto\\vec a])(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\na_{\\iota i&lt;k\\ (x_i=y)},&amp;y\\in\\{x_i:i&lt;k\\},\\\\\ns(y),&amp;y\\notin\\{x_i:i&lt;k\\},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n⟦ x⟧_{M,s}&amp;\\coloneqq s(x),&amp;\n⟦ f(\\vec t)⟧_{M,s}&amp;\\coloneqq f^M((⟦ t_i⟧_{M,s})_i),\\\\\nM,s\\models(t=u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow⟦ t⟧_{M,s}=⟦ u⟧_{M,s},\\\\\nM,s\\models R(\\vec t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(⟦ t_i⟧_{M,s})_i\\in R^M,\\\\\nM,s\\models\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(M,s\\models\\varphi),\\\\\nM,s\\models\\varphi\\land\\psi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(M,s\\models\\varphi)\\land(M,s\\models\\psi),\\\\\nM,s\\models\\forall x\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in|M|\\ (M,s[x\\mapsto a]\\models\\varphi),\\\\\nM\\models\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in|M|^{\\mathrm{Var}_L}\\ (M,s\\models\\varphi),\\\\\nM\\models T&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\ (M\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathcal F_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(0,(\\epsilon\\mapsto0)),\n(S,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto n+1)),\n(+,(\\langle m,n\\rangle\\mapsto m+n)),\n(\\times,(\\langle m,n\\rangle\\mapsto mn))\\},\\\\\n\\mathbb N_A&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\mathcal F_A,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Str}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Str}_L\\)</span> 在允许所有集合载体时是类记号。涉及类上量化的句子按集合论模式理解，不将所有结构误当成一个集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"97e929795d778cd6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L=(F_L,R_L,a_L)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"|M|","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|M|","display":false},{"tex":"s[x\\mapsto a]","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"M\\models\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"M\\models T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N_A\\models\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"M=(M_0,M_1,M_2)","display":false},{"tex":"A^0=\\{\\epsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_A","display":false},{"tex":"m,n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0,S,+,\\times","display":false},{"tex":"L_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Str}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in|M|","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a\\in|M|^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Str}_L&\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal R):A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal F)=F_L\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R)=R_L\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in F_L\\ (\\mathcal F(f):A^{a_L(f)}\\to A)\n\\land\\forall R\\in R_L\\ (\\mathcal R(R)\\subseteq A^{a_L(R)})\\},\\\\\n|M|&\\coloneqq M_0,&f^M&\\coloneqq M_1(f),&R^M&\\coloneqq M_2(R),\\\\\n(s[x\\mapsto a])(y)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&y=x,\\\\s(y),&y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(s[\\vec x\\mapsto\\vec a])(y)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\na_{\\iota i<k\\ (x_i=y)},&y\\in\\{x_i:i<k\\},\\\\\ns(y),&y\\notin\\{x_i:i<k\\},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n⟦ x⟧_{M,s}&\\coloneqq s(x),&\n⟦ f(\\vec t)⟧_{M,s}&\\coloneqq f^M((⟦ t_i⟧_{M,s})_i),\\\\\nM,s\\models(t=u)&\\Longleftrightarrow⟦ t⟧_{M,s}=⟦ u⟧_{M,s},\\\\\nM,s\\models R(\\vec t)&\\Longleftrightarrow(⟦ t_i⟧_{M,s})_i\\in R^M,\\\\\nM,s\\models\\neg\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(M,s\\models\\varphi),\\\\\nM,s\\models\\varphi\\land\\psi&\\Longleftrightarrow(M,s\\models\\varphi)\\land(M,s\\models\\psi),\\\\\nM,s\\models\\forall x\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in|M|\\ (M,s[x\\mapsto a]\\models\\varphi),\\\\\nM\\models\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in|M|^{\\mathrm{Var}_L}\\ (M,s\\models\\varphi),\\\\\nM\\models T&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\ (M\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathcal F_A&\\coloneqq\\{(0,(\\epsilon\\mapsto0)),\n(S,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto n+1)),\n(+,(\\langle m,n\\rangle\\mapsto m+n)),\n(\\times,(\\langle m,n\\rangle\\mapsto mn))\\},\\\\\n\\mathbb N_A&\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\mathcal F_A,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Str}_L","display":false}],"bytes":3482,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau$ 遍历集合大小的一阶签名；$\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma$、约化、同构与一阶满足关系取 [[67-df-satisfaction]]、[[67-df-isomorphism]]。关于所有签名、结构的量化在元理论中进行。"},{"id":"5fa3acf328238c71","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2aa449de50b1c012","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L,K$ 为 [[67-df-syntax-interface]] 的签名；结构及其解释族取 [[67-df-satisfaction]]。每个下列构造仅在其列明的输入类型上定义。"},{"id":"336238f06be8e591","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f115352299e944bf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a548cb5c1ed94888","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"下式定义 $\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}$、自由变量、句子及满足关系。原子、否定、合取、全称量词的语义递归与 [[67-df-satisfaction]] 完全相同，但递归子式取扩展公式。"},{"id":"cb812f5c5aa42196","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L=L_A$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetic-language]]；$\\mathbb N_A\\in\\mathrm{Str}_{L_A}$ 是 [[67-df-satisfaction]] 指定的标准算术结构，$\\models_{L_A}$ 为同一满足关系。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-satisfaction]] — Structures and Tarskian Satisfaction。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-satisfaction]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-satisfaction]]"}],"outgoing":["2035a1f4d72e7df9","97e929795d778cd6"]}